Bind Npc 24410 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 14410 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 519 "[Descendant of Hero] preparation is the best part of the Festival III"
    Journal for karus "You have to deliver festival goods to the [Royal Chef] at Luferson Castle."
    Journal for elmorad "You have to deliver festival goods to the [Royal Chef] at El Morad Castle."
    Collect 1 of 910209000

Requires player level >= 60 and quest 518 is completed

Rewards
    Give 1 of 910210000
    Give 125000 experience
    Give 30000 coins

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "You just need to give the [Royal Chef] the [Festival Preparation Box]. He is in Luferson Castle."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You just need to give the [Royal Chef] the [Festival Preparation Box]. He is in El Morad Castle."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "You are <selfname> aren't you? What brings you here?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "You came to deliver this from Bellua Village? I was waiting for it, let's see ...\n\nDeliver [Celebration Preparation Box] to [Castle Cook]."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You are <selfname> aren't you? What brings you here?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "You came to deliver this from Asga Village? I was waiting for it, let's see ...\n\nDeliver [Celebration Preparation Box] to [Castle Cook]."

On in_progress
    Say "Blast! It is not the right stuff ..."

On claimable
    Show quest "Well, well, shall we get the food started? It'll be over soon, give me a minute."
